// The subprocess rows of the raw surface (`__Builtins.subprocess*`) call their runtime entries with the words, the byte arrays and the
// cstrings (a String's two words) they were given, and the runtime answers a word or a fresh byte array.

function lowerSubprocessSpawn(mutates l Lowerer, p ast.Project, ms ast.ModuleState, c CallSite, recv Reg, args RegList) returns Reg
	return entry(l, p: p, site: siteOf(l, p: p, node: c.node), symbol: Rt.rtSubprocessSpawn, kind: IrKind.kindScalar, args: args)
end 'lowerSubprocessSpawn'

